{"id":"5fb4984fbec82c2e","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters.md","title":"两个栈可由三个计数器模拟","display":"thm-two-stacks-three-counters — 两个栈可由三个计数器模拟","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters","aliases":["73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters"],"display":"thm-two-stacks-three-counters — 两个栈可由三个计数器模拟","depends_on":["[[73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic]]","[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine]]","[[73-df-endmarked-counter-machine]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.14, print pp. 359–360; PDF pp. 381–382","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-two-stacks-three-counters — 两个栈可由三个计数器模拟"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ed4d89a0622f889\" href=\"?note=5ed4d89a0622f889\" title=\"73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic\">73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"812a4642483884b6\" href=\"?note=812a4642483884b6\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine\">73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"568502bf56055515\" href=\"?note=568502bf56055515\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine\">73-df-endmarked-counter-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.14, print pp. 359–360; PDF pp. 381–382"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)\\)</span>。三个计数器模拟机的结束字符由 Assertion 中的投影等式约束；两个机器的元组次序采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists N\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,3}(N)\\land\\pi_3(N)=\\pi_8(M)\\land\nL_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(N)=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists N\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,3}(N)\\land\\pi_3(N)=\\pi_8(M)\\land\nL_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(N)=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个计数器分别保存两栈的 r 进制整数，第三个作暂存。乘 r：原计数每减一，暂存增加 r，再搬回。除 r：有限控制循环计数至 r，每完成一组暂存加一，余数留在状态，再搬回商；由余数取得栈顶。一次栈替换分成有限次弹、换、推。每个内部循环只在有限计数上运行，最终暂存恢复零；不把计数器一次乘 r 当成原生一步。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5ed4d89a0622f889","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine","status":"resolved","id":"812a4642483884b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine","status":"resolved","id":"568502bf56055515","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-counter-machine]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StackMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F,\\$)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists N\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,3}(N)\\land\\pi_3(N)=\\pi_8(M)\\land\nL_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(N)=L_{\\mathsf{stk},2}(M)].","display":true}],"bytes":1692,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters|两个栈可由三个计数器模拟]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"c955310a21272c92","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5ed4d89a0622f889","812a4642483884b6","568502bf56055515"]}